==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Zory]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Zombies pose very little threat, as their magnification is far too low to have any meaningful impact. Strong attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] can easily take care of the two Zories that spawn, as well as the Zrocos. The St. Pigge is the main threat of the stage, but a high level [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] should be more than enough for her.

